// # LSP Docs Index — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Index of the LSP documentation files.
//
// Setup: LSP_SETUP.oot is the editor-facing setup doc. protocol.oot and client_config.oot cover the wire protocol and client config. CAPABILITIES.oot is the SSoT for what the server advertises in `initialize`.
//
// Beats:
//   1. LSP_SETUP.oot — how to launch the LSP server, capabilities, configuration.
//   2. protocol.oot — the JSON-RPC 2.0 wire protocol details.
//   3. client_config.oot — how to configure LSP clients (editors, settings).
//   4. CAPABILITIES.oot — the server's capability declaration: what is and is not advertised, and why.

import "LSP_SETUP.oot";
import "protocol.oot";
import "client_config.oot";
import "CAPABILITIES.oot";
